[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:63. Thank You, Doctor]
[00:00.720]Lesson 63 | 第63课
[00:02.835]How's Jimmy today? | 吉米今天怎么样？
[00:05.465]He's better, thank you, doctor. | 他好多了，谢谢你，医生。
[00:07.845]Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams? | 威廉姆斯夫人，我能见见他吗？
[00:10.555]Certainly, doctor. | 当然可以，医生。
[00:12.260]Come upstairs. | 上楼来吧。
[00:14.625]You look very well, Jimmy. | 你看起来很好，吉米。
[00:17.730]You are better now. | 你现在好多了。
[00:19.755]But you mustn't get up yet. | 但你还不能起床。
[00:21.945]You must stay in bed for another two days. | 你必须再卧床两天。
[00:26.725]The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams. | 威廉姆斯夫人，这孩子还不能去学校。
[00:31.585]And he mustn't eat rich food. | 他也不能吃油腻的食物。
[00:34.440]Has he a temperature, doctor? | 他发烧了吗，医生？
[00:36.890]No, he hasn't. | 不，他没有。
[00:38.460]Must he stay in bed? | 他必须卧床吗？
[00:40.370]Yes, he must remain in bed for another two days. | 是的，他必须再卧床两天。
[00:44.965]He can get up for about two hours each day. | 他每天可以起床大约两个小时。
[00:49.125]But you must keep the room warm. | 但你必须保持房间温暖。
[00:53.235]Where's Mr. Williams this evening? | 威廉姆斯先生今晚在哪里？
[00:56.860]He's in bed, doctor. | 他在床上，医生。
[00:59.225]Can you see him, please? | 你能见见他吗？
[01:01.615]He has a bad cold too. | 他也得了重感冒。